<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ACE*COMM started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ACE*COMM started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer started coverage of ACE*COMM Corp with a buy rating, an Oppenheimer source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at nine Friday.</p>
